{"clock":1,"nonce":"bd187a427005c67a450177dcc395f009","ops":[{"kind":"create","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793807404,"origin":{"forge":"github.com/guilbep/git-board","event":"issue:6206257736"},"data":{"body":"Follow-up of #76 (PR #81). Two edges of the Markdown files datastore (`core/mdstore`, `internal/store/datastore.go`), found in review, left as they are.\n\n**1. Two processes rendering the files.** `git board serve` and a `git board` command (or two commands) on one Markdown board each read hand edits in before a write and render the files after (`readMarkdown`, `renderMarkdown`), under an in-process lock only. Two processes at once can both import the same hand edit (one wins, the other sees a conflict) or render over each other's file. Want: the read-in and render take a lock file in `\u003cdir\u003e/.board/` (as a pack write does), held across import, write and render.\n\n**2. A stale pack lock taken over twice.** `mdstore.lock` takes over a lock file older than 30 s (a writer that crashed). Two waiters can both see it stale; the second then removes the lock the first just took, and both append. Needs a crashed writer first. Want: take over by renaming the stale file to a unique name and checking (`os.SameFile`) that what was renamed is the file seen stale; otherwise put it back and wait.\n\n**Acceptance.**\n1. A test runs two backends on one Markdown folder writing in a loop: every write lands, no file holds a torn line, and no hand edit is imported twice.\n2. A test leaves a stale lock and starts two writers: exactly one takes it over at a time.\n\nAlso out of the review, to mention in this issue's PR: the forge-only `datastore drop` counts a write sent at once by the server as waiting until a whole `git board sync` runs (it errs on keeping).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_","title":"datastores: one renderer for a Markdown board, and a safe lock takeover"}},{"kind":"set-status","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793822097,"origin":{"forge":"github.com/guilbep/git-board","event":"issue:6206257736"},"data":{"status":"closed"}},{"kind":"change-labels","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793822097,"origin":{"forge":"github.com/guilbep/git-board","event":"issue:6206257736"},"data":{"add":["feat"],"remove":null}}]}